Just ride out there with me and take a look at it.

00:21:59.280 --> 00:21:59.820
I don't understand.

00:22:00.030 --> 00:22:05.760
what good that'll do the authorities investigated it thoroughly the sheriff thinks in terms of crime

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:12.020
and publicity you're a scientist you think in terms of cause and effect maybe you'll see

00:22:12.020 --> 00:22:25.070
something that the sheriff missed that shouldn't be too difficult still i i don't know what's he

00:22:25.070 --> 00:22:29.970
saying he says that uh that your lips are easy to read that your theory may

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:40.280
you a very bright girl in his book and that he'd like to go along with us good when you barge into

00:22:40.280 --> 00:22:44.460
people's lives and drag them off to places they don't really want to go aren't you sort of in

00:22:44.460 --> 00:22:52.440
danger of becoming unpopular that's an occupational hazard how'd you pick such an occupation i think

00:22:52.440 --> 00:22:58.560
it sort of picked me i guess i was just born inquisitive ever since i can remember i wanted

00:22:58.560 --> 00:22:59.880
to know the why and wherefore

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:10.360
Just about everything I saw I inherited my knack with the camera from dad. My curiosity supplied the nose for news and the camera supplied the memory

00:23:11.340 --> 00:23:17.580
So there you have it. What about you? Have you always been interested in science?

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:20.910
Oh, I guess I always have been in one way or another

00:23:20.910 --> 00:23:24.890
I used to fool around with radios and anything electrical when I was a kid

00:23:24.890 --> 00:23:28.940
I was a radar officer during the war and then I went into this when I got out

00:23:32.260 --> 00:23:39.640
Ah, yes, I remember now that every time I read one of your articles it was datelined from some area of flood or famine or war.

00:23:40.170 --> 00:23:43.070
Made me realize what a sheltered life we scientists really lead.

00:23:44.750 --> 00:23:47.990
Sheltered? Look what happened to Frank.

00:25:00.160 --> 00:25:03.760
to me as though some force had to push these walls out from the inside.

00:25:04.380 --> 00:25:05.360
